# ==========================================================
# 二进制文件：告诉 git 不要做换行符转换
# ==========================================================
# 不写这一段会出事：手写的 sample_plan_en.pdf 全是 ASCII、
# 没有 NUL 字节，git 会误判成文本文件，检出时按 CRLF 转换，
# 结果 PDF 直接损坏打不开。
*.pdf   binary
*.docx  binary
*.doc    binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.zip   binary
*.gz    binary
*.gguf  binary
*.bin   binary
*.wav   binary
*.mp3   binary

# 这些文件不做行级 diff（二进制 diff 没有意义，还占空间）
*.pdf   -diff
*.docx  -diff

# ==========================================================
# 文本文件：仓库里统一存 LF，检出时由 core.autocrlf 决定本地形式
# ==========================================================
*.py    text
*.md    text
*.txt   text
*.yaml  text
*.yml   text
*.json  text
*.sql   text
*.html  text
*.css   text
*.js    text
*.http  text
*.gitignore text
*.gitattributes text
